00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.940
Good evening. Welcome to the table.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:03.440
My name is James. Pronouns are he and him.

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:06.959
We got a few announcements to start off.

00:05:07.059 --> 00:05:09.679
First announcement, we have

00:05:09.679 --> 00:05:12.260
Not Your Mama Sunday School class

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:15.040
beginning one week from today on Sunday

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:17.720
April 21st at 3pm.

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:21.260
We're launching our first

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:24.320
sprint style meet up called Not Your Mama

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:27.000
Sunday School class. A sprint meet up

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.179
is one that only starts for a short amount of time.

00:05:30.179 --> 00:05:32.779
In this case, the class will meet for five

00:05:32.779 --> 00:05:35.359
Sundays only from 3 to 4

00:05:35.359 --> 00:05:38.140
30pm right here at

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:40.559
Saxy First. It's a class for anyone

00:05:40.559 --> 00:05:43.019
who wants to read and discuss the Bible

00:05:43.019 --> 00:05:45.420
in a way that considers scholarship

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:48.200
and welcomes diversity of thought.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:51.540
You don't need to sign up. Simply show up here

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:53.920
at 3pm next week with your Bible

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.760
in an open heart and mind.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:00.380
Then we have the Welcome to the Table

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.160
class two weeks from today on Sunday

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:05.899
April 28th from 3 to

00:06:05.899 --> 00:06:09.260
4.30pm right here at Saxy First again.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.000
We're offering a class to facilitate

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.880
by Pastor Brett designed both for

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:17.559
those wanting more information about the table

00:06:17.559 --> 00:06:20.559
as well as those wanting to make this community

00:06:20.559 --> 00:06:24.100
their official church home. If that sounds like you

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:27.019
then scan the QR code to sign up.

00:06:29.459 --> 00:06:30.459
Now,

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.679
let me give you a minute to settle

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:36.059
to finish filling out a form, put away your

00:06:36.059 --> 00:06:37.059
cell phone.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.700
Allow the cares of the world to fall away.

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:48.739
Now we enter a sacred space.

00:06:50.019 --> 00:06:51.820
A space for prayer,

00:06:52.239 --> 00:06:54.859
worship, and adoration.

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:58.880
A space where we center on Christ.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.100
The one who made us, who sees us,

00:07:03.339 --> 00:07:05.399
and who loves us.

00:07:06.339 --> 00:07:09.160
So don't feel like you have to figure

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:10.160
everything out.

00:07:11.019 --> 00:07:14.619
Don't feel like you have to force a change.

00:07:14.959 --> 00:07:17.059
Simply open yourself

00:07:17.459 --> 00:07:20.359
to whatever God has for you.

00:07:20.799 --> 00:07:23.619
Simply open yourself to what

00:07:23.619 --> 00:07:26.579
God has for you. We have come

00:07:26.579 --> 00:07:27.579
to worship.

00:07:28.239 --> 00:07:30.079
So let's worship well.

00:07:34.179 --> 00:07:35.179
Thank you so much.

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.380
Would you guys stand with us?

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:41.279
We're going to get started with brighter days and I know

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:45.540
I know enough of you to know that our days are not always bright.

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:48.700
There have been mixes of storms

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:51.019
and clouds and rain and chaos

00:07:51.579 --> 00:07:54.579
for so many of us and I hope that as we start this

00:07:54.579 --> 00:07:57.540
service together that we can hold on to a little bit of hope.

00:07:58.619 --> 00:08:01.339
That those days do come to an end.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:04.420
And sometimes even in the midst of the storm, we find

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:07.420
that center of peace, that center of God's love

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.380
and calm and let's hold on to that together.

